                    child: Icon(
                      icon,
                      color: color,
                    ),
                  ),
                  const Spacer(),
                  Text(
                    number,
                    style: TextStyle(
                      color: color.withValues(alpha: .45),
                      fontSize: 22,
                      fontWeight: FontWeight.w900,
